"settings.about.history.v355.build56.stability" = "Fixed a background-task crash and wallet-refresh timeout alerts. Temporary refresh failures keep existing wallet information available.";
"settings.about.history.v355.build56.backup" = "Cleaner backup screens with correct opening titles and fewer messages. Private-key access respects App Lock settings. Compact glass import warnings clear rejected input when you choose another recovery phrase.";

